// Predators & Stealth -- PalSchema aggression patch. Hand-edit freely; restart the game after.
// Retune a category with find & replace -- HearingRate (heard m): 16.0 sharp-eared | 10.0 default | 6.0 deaf.
// Knobs per pal: AIResponse (hostility) | ViewingDistance (aggro/sight m, flat 25) | HearingRate (heard m).
// AIResponse tags: Warlike | Warlike_Anyway | NotInterested | Escape | Friendly | (Kill_All/Boss avoid).
// IMPORTANT: species that are VANILLA "Escape_to_Battle" (86 of them) IGNORE a flip to plain "Warlike" --
//   they stay stuck in a flee/investigate loop and never actually attack. Use "Warlike_Anyway" for those;
//   it overrides the escape state so they commit to the attack (verified in-game). NotInterested/Escape
//   baselines obey plain "Warlike" fine. So: Escape_to_Battle -> Warlike_Anyway, everything else -> Warlike.
// Sight is a flat 25 for all -- no level/threat scaling (see MODPAGE for why). Tune per pal if you want.
// Prey (passive) = the species simply ABSENT from this file.
{
